        <tei:head xml:lang="en">The Chapter of Mannah</tei:head>
        <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">According to the Jerusalem Talmud, one who recites this Torah chapter every day is assured that he will never lack for food. The prayer preceding the Torah chapter should not be recited on Shabbos or Yom Tov.</tei:note>
